msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "鍵盤快捷鍵"

msgid "Restart calibre now"
msgstr "立即重新啟動 calibre"

msgid "Preferences for:"
msgstr "偏好設定："

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除"

msgid "Clear all settings for this plugin"
msgstr "清除這個外掛的所有設定"

msgid "Are you sure you want to change your settings in this library for this plugin?"
msgstr "你確定要變更這個資料庫中此外掛的設定嗎？"

msgid "Any settings in other libraries or stored in a JSON file in your calibre plugins folder will not be touched."
msgstr "其他資料庫中的設定，或儲存在 calibre 外掛資料夾 JSON 檔中的設定，都不會被影響。"

msgid "You must restart calibre afterwards."
msgstr "完成後你必須重新啟動 calibre。"

msgid "Settings changed"
msgstr "設定已變更"

msgid "Settings for this plugin in this library have been changed."
msgstr "這個資料庫中的外掛設定已變更。"

msgid "Please restart calibre now."
msgstr "請立即重新啟動 calibre。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to clear your settings in this library for this plugin?"
msgstr "你確定要清除這個資料庫中此外掛的設定嗎？"

msgid "Settings deleted"
msgstr "設定已刪除"

msgid "All settings for this plugin in this library have been cleared."
msgstr "這個資料庫中此外掛的所有設定都已清除。"

msgid "Copy to clipboard"
msgstr "複製到剪貼簿"

msgid "Undefined"
msgstr "未定義"

msgid "Restart required"
msgstr "需要重新啟動"

msgid "Title image not found - you must restart Calibre before using this plugin!"
msgstr "找不到標題圖片，使用此外掛前必須先重新啟動 calibre！"

msgid "Create new column"
msgstr "建立新欄位"

msgid "Count Pages"
msgstr "頁數統計"

msgid "&Estimate page/word counts"
msgstr "&估算頁數/字數"

msgid "&Download page/word counts - all sources"
msgstr "&從所有來源下載頁數/字數"

msgid "&Statistic totals for selected books"
msgstr "&選取書籍的統計總計"

msgid "&Customize plugin"
msgstr "&自訂外掛"

msgid "&Help"
msgstr "&說明"

msgid "Configure plugin"
msgstr "設定外掛"

msgid "You must specify custom column(s) first. Do you want to configure this now?"
msgstr "你必須先指定自訂欄位。要現在設定嗎？"

msgid "Count Page/Word Statistics"
msgstr "計算頁數/字數統計"

msgid "Counting statistics in %d books"
msgstr "正在計算 %d 本書的統計資料"

msgid "Failed to count statistics"
msgstr "統計資料計算失敗"

msgid "Counting statistics batch completed"
msgstr "這批統計資料計算完成"

msgid "Failed to generate any statistics. <b>View Log</b> for details"
msgstr "無法產生任何統計資料。請查看 <b>檢視記錄</b> 以取得詳細資訊"

msgid "Count Pages failed"
msgstr "頁數統計失敗"

msgid "Count log"
msgstr "計算記錄"

msgid "<p>Count Pages plugin found <b>%d statistics(s)</b>. "
msgstr "<p>Count Pages 外掛找到 <b>%d 筆統計資料</b>。 "

msgid "Proceed with updating columns in your library?"
msgstr "要更新資料庫中的欄位嗎？"

msgid "Count complete"
msgstr "計算完成"

msgid "Updating statistics"
msgstr "正在更新統計資料"

msgid "Updating"
msgstr "正在更新"

msgid "Selected"
msgstr "已選取"

msgid "Paragraphs (APNX accurate)"
msgstr "段落數（APNX 精準）"

msgid "E-book Viewer (calibre)"
msgstr "calibre 電子書檢視器"

msgid "Adobe Digital Editions (ADE)"
msgstr "Adobe Digital Editions（ADE）"

msgid "Custom (Chars Per Page)"
msgstr "自訂（每頁字元數）"

msgid "Download page/word counts"
msgstr "下載頁數/字數"

msgid "Estimate page/word counts"
msgstr "估算頁數/字數"

msgid " - all sources"
msgstr " - 所有來源"

msgid "Selected Books"
msgstr "已選取書籍"

msgid "Page Count"
msgstr "頁數"

msgid "Word Count"
msgstr "字數"

msgid "Flesch Reading Ease"
msgstr "Flesch 閱讀易讀度"

msgid "Flesch-Kincaid Grade Level"
msgstr "Flesch-Kincaid 年級程度"

msgid "Gunning Fog Index"
msgstr "Gunning Fog 指數"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計資料"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

msgid "Download options:"
msgstr "下載選項："

msgid "Move source up (Alt+Up)"
msgstr "將來源上移（Alt+Up）"

msgid "Alt+Up"
msgstr "Alt+Up"

msgid "Move source down (Alt+Down)"
msgstr "將來源下移（Alt+Down）"

msgid "Alt+Down"
msgstr "Alt+Down"

msgid "Show download from all sources menu item"
msgstr "顯示「從所有來源下載」選單項目"

msgid "Try to download page count from each source"
msgstr "嘗試從每個來源下載頁數"

msgid "Other options:"
msgstr "其他選項："

msgid "&Button default:"
msgstr "&按鈕預設動作："

msgid "If plugin is placed as a toolbar button, choose a default action when clicked on"
msgstr "如果外掛被放在工具列按鈕上，請選擇點擊時的預設動作"

msgid "Batch size:"
msgstr "批次大小："

msgid "Always overwrite an existing word/page count"
msgstr "一律覆寫現有的字數/頁數"

msgid "Update the statistics even if they have not changed"
msgstr "即使統計資料沒有變更也要更新"

msgid "Use Preferred Output Format if available"
msgstr "若可用則使用偏好的輸出格式"

msgid "Prompt to save counts"
msgstr "儲存統計時提示確認"

msgid "Edit the keyboard shortcuts associated with this plugin"
msgstr "編輯這個外掛的鍵盤快捷鍵"

msgid "&Library preferences"
msgstr "&資料庫偏好設定"

msgid "View data stored in the library database for this plugin"
msgstr "檢視儲存在資料庫中的這個外掛資料"

msgid "Done"
msgstr "完成"

msgid "Confirmation dialogs have all been reset"
msgstr "確認對話框已全部重設"

msgid "Source"
msgstr "來源"

msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "識別碼"

msgid "On Menu"
msgstr "顯示於選單"

msgid "Page count options:"
msgstr "頁數選項："

msgid "&Custom column:"
msgstr "&自訂欄位："

msgid "Column must be of type float or int. Leave this blank if you do not want to count pages"
msgstr "欄位必須為 float 或 int 類型。如果不想計算頁數，請留白。"

msgid "&Algorithm:"
msgstr "&演算法："

msgid "Choose which algorithm to use if you have specified a page count column"
msgstr "如果你已指定頁數欄位，請選擇要使用的演算法"

msgid "C&hars per page:"
msgstr "&每頁字元數："

msgid "If using the Custom algorithm, specify how many characters per page including spaces."
msgstr "如果使用自訂演算法，請指定每頁字元數，包含空白字元。"

msgid "Word count options:"
msgstr "字數選項："

msgid "C&ustom column:"
msgstr "&自訂欄位："

msgid "Column must be of type float or int. Leave this blank if you do not want to count words"
msgstr "欄位必須為 float 或 int 類型。如果不想計算字數，請留白。"

msgid "Use ICU algorithm"
msgstr "使用 ICU 演算法"

msgid "Readability options:"
msgstr "可讀性選項："

msgid "Readability statistics available are <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flesch-Kincaid_readability_test\">Flesch-Kincaid</a> or <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunning_fog_index\">Gunning Fog Index</a>."
msgstr "可用的可讀性統計有 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flesch-Kincaid_readability_test\">Flesch-Kincaid</a> 或 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gunning_fog_index\">Gunning Fog 指數</a>。"

msgid "Working"
msgstr "處理中"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Queueing books for counting statistics"
msgstr "正在將書籍加入統計計算佇列"

msgid "ADOBE page count requires EPUB format"
msgstr "ADOBE 頁數計算需要 EPUB 格式"

msgid "Book already has all statistics and overwrite is turned off"
msgstr "此書已經有所有統計資料，而且已關閉覆寫。"

msgid "No identifiers for selected download sources"
msgstr "所選下載來源沒有識別碼"

msgid "Queueing "
msgstr "正在排入佇列 "

msgid "No format found for word count, but page count download will be attempted"
msgstr "找不到可用格式來計算字數，但仍會嘗試下載頁數"

msgid "No convertible format found"
msgstr "找不到可轉換的格式"

msgid "Could not analyse some statistics in %d of %d books, for reasons shown in details below."
msgstr "無法分析 %d 本中的 %d 本書的部分統計資料，原因如以下詳細資訊所示。"

msgid "Page/word/statistics warnings"
msgstr "頁數/字數/統計資料警告"

msgid "Statistic Totals"
msgstr "統計總計"

msgid "Statistic"
msgstr "統計項目"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "總計"

msgid "Average"
msgstr "平均"

msgid "Some books were skipped due to missing statistic values."
msgstr "有些書籍因缺少統計值而被略過。"

msgid "Count the number of pages and/or words in a book\nto store in custom column(s)"
msgstr "計算書籍的頁數及／或字數，\n並儲存到自訂欄位"

msgid "Show a menu item to attempt to download the page\ncount from all active sources. Only sources for which\nthe book has an id will be tried.\n"
msgstr "顯示從所有啟用來源下載頁數的選單項目。\n只會嘗試書籍具有對應識別碼的來源。\n"

msgid "If this option is checked, each download source is\ntried until a page count is successfully\nfetched.\n"
msgstr "勾選後會逐一嘗試各個下載來源，\n直到成功取得頁數為止。\n"

msgid "When calculating statistics for a large number of books,\nthe plugin will process the books in batches per calibre job."
msgstr "計算大量書籍的統計資料時，\n外掛會將書籍分批交給各個 calibre 工作處理。"

msgid "Uncheck this option if you have manually populated values in\neither of your page/word custom columns, and never want the\nplugin to overwrite it. Acts as a convenience option for users\nwho have the toolbar button configured to populate both page\nand word count, but for some books have already assigned values\ninto a column and just want the zero/blank column populated."
msgstr "如果你已手動填入頁數或字數自訂欄位，\n而且不希望外掛覆寫，請取消勾選。\n若工具列按鈕設定為同時計算頁數與字數，\n但部分書籍已有其中一個欄位的值，\n此選項可讓外掛只填入值為零或空白的欄位。"

msgid "Check this option if you want the statistics to be updated in\nthe books metadata even if they have not changed. Using this\noption will always update the modified timestamp for the book\neven when the statistics have not changed."
msgstr "勾選後，即使統計資料沒有變更，\n仍會更新書籍中繼資料中的統計值。\n此選項一律會更新書籍的修改時間，\n即使統計資料維持不變。"

msgid "Check this option to calculate the statistics using the format selected\nas the Preferred Output Format. If this format is not found, or the\noption is not checked, the first format found in the Preferred Input\nFormat list will be used. The Preferred Output and Input settings\nare specified in Behavior page of the calibre Preferences.\nNote: ePub will always be used if the ADE page count algorithm is selected."
msgstr "勾選後會使用「偏好的輸出格式」計算統計資料。\n如果找不到此格式或未勾選此選項，\n會使用「偏好的輸入格式」清單中第一個可用格式。\n你可以在 calibre 偏好設定的「行為」頁面\n設定偏好的輸出與輸入格式。\n注意：選用 ADE 頁數演算法時，一律使用 EPUB。"

msgid "Uncheck this option if you want changes applied without\na confirmation dialog. There is a small risk with this\noption unchecked that if you are making other changes to\nthis book record at the same time they will be lost."
msgstr "若要直接套用變更而不顯示確認對話框，\n請取消勾選。如果同時對同一筆書籍記錄\n進行其他修改，取消勾選可能會使\n那些同時進行的修改遺失。"

msgid "The ICU algorithm is a more complete word count and supports multiple locales.\nUncheck this to use the original word count algorithm."
msgstr "ICU 演算法提供較完整的字數計算，並支援多種語系。\n取消勾選可改用原本的字數計算演算法。"

msgid "Specify the custom column to store a computed Flesch Reading Ease score.\nLeave this blank if you do not want to calculate it"
msgstr "指定儲存 Flesch 閱讀易讀度分數的自訂欄位。\n如果不想計算，請留白"

msgid "Specify the custom column to store a computed Flesch-Kincaid Grade Level score.\nLeave this blank if you do not want to calculate it"
msgstr "指定儲存 Flesch-Kincaid 年級程度分數的自訂欄位。\n如果不想計算，請留白"

msgid "Specify the custom column to store a computed Gunning Fog Index score.\nLeave this blank if you do not want to calculate it"
msgstr "指定儲存 Gunning Fog 指數分數的自訂欄位。\n如果不想計算，請留白"
